{
	"name": "Helping Hand",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/skills/social/wave-halt-stop.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Whenever you or your companion fail a Strength or Dexterity saving throw to be knocked prone or otherwise moved against your will while within 5ft of each other, the other can offer a helping hand as a reaction. This negates the forced movement or being knocked prone. If you are both moved or knocked prone at the same time, you gain no benefit from this feature.</p><p>Similarly, if either of you are forcibly moved into the other’s threatened area, the same reaction can be used to end the forced movement.</p>",
